# Core dumps. The test binaries abort at teardown under a gtest_filter (the
# IsMainThread CHECK in vmsdk/src/utils.h), leaving core.<pid> in the repo
# root. Matched narrowly so a source file named core.cc or core.py, or a
# directory named core/, is not silently ignored.
/core
core.[0-9]*
